{"id":"u12","kelas":8,"no":3,"judul":"Membandingkan","title":"Comparing Things","emoji":"⚖️","ringkas":"Comparative dan superlative: taller, the tallest, more beautiful","ready":true,"goals":["membandingkan dua hal dengan **comparative**: [[taller than]], [[more beautiful than]]","menyebut yang paling dengan **superlative**: [[the tallest]], [[the most expensive]]","mengenal bentuk tidak beraturan: [[better]], [[the best]], [[worse]], [[the worst]]","membandingkan kesamaan dengan [[as ... as]]","membuat kalimat membandingkan orang, hewan, benda, dan tempat"],"lesson":[{"t":"intro","text":"Siapa yang **lebih tinggi**, kamu atau temanmu? Hewan apa yang **paling cepat**? Untuk menjawabnya kita memakai **comparative** (lebih) dan **superlative** (paling). Itulah topik **Unit 3**."},{"t":"grammar","title":"1. Tiga tingkat kata sifat","text":"Satu kata sifat punya tiga tingkat:","table":[["Tingkat","Artinya","Contoh"],["**Positive**","biasa","[[Budi is tall.]]"],["**Comparative**","lebih ... (membandingkan 2)","[[Budi is taller than Rani.]]"],["**Superlative**","paling ... (dari 3 atau lebih)","[[Budi is the tallest in the class.]]"]]},{"t":"grammar","title":"2. Kata sifat pendek (satu suku kata): -er dan -est","table":[["Aturan","Positive","Comparative","Superlative"],["Tambah **-er / -est**","tall","taller","the tallest"],["","fast","faster","the fastest"],["Berakhiran **e**: tambah **-r / -st**","large","larger","the largest"],["Konsonan-vokal-konsonan: **gandakan** konsonan","big","bigger","the biggest"],["","hot","hotter","the hottest"],["Berakhiran konsonan + **y**: ganti jadi **-ier / -iest**","happy","happier","the happiest"],["","easy","easier","the easiest"]]},{"t":"grammar","title":"3. Kata sifat panjang (dua suku kata atau lebih): more dan most","text":"Jangan tambah -er/-est. Pakai **more** dan **the most**.","table":[["Positive","Comparative","Superlative"],["beautiful","**more** beautiful","**the most** beautiful"],["expensive","**more** expensive","**the most** expensive"],["interesting","**more** interesting","**the most** interesting"],["difficult","**more** difficult","**the most** difficult"]]},{"t":"warn","title":"Jangan dobel","text":"Pilih **salah satu**: -er **atau** more. Salah: *more taller* atau *more beautifuler*. Benar: [[taller]] dan [[more beautiful]]."},{"t":"vocab","title":"4. Bentuk tidak beraturan (Irregular)","items":[{"en":"good → better → the best","id":"baik → lebih baik → terbaik","ex":"This is the best cake."},{"en":"bad → worse → the worst","id":"buruk → lebih buruk → terburuk","ex":"Today is worse than yesterday."},{"en":"far → farther → the farthest","id":"jauh → lebih jauh → terjauh","ex":"Bali is farther than Bandung."}]},{"t":"grammar","title":"5. Kalimat membandingkan","table":[["Jenis","Pola","Contoh"],["Comparative","subjek + is/are + adjective-**er**/**more** + **than** + pembanding","[[A cheetah is faster than a lion.]]"],["Superlative","subjek + is/are + **the** + adjective-**est**/**most**","[[An elephant is the biggest land animal.]]"],["Sama dengan","subjek + is/are + **as** + adjective + **as** + pembanding","[[Rani is as tall as Dina.]]"],["Tidak sama","subjek + is/are + **not as** + adjective + **as**","[[My bag is not as heavy as yours.]]"]]},{"t":"tip","title":"Than dan the","text":"Comparative selalu diikuti **than** (daripada). Superlative selalu didahului **the**: [[the tallest]], [[the most expensive]]."},{"t":"dialog","title":"Dialog: Memilih sepatu","lines":[{"who":"Rani","en":"Look at these shoes. This pair is cheaper than that one.","id":"Lihat sepatu ini. Pasangan ini lebih murah daripada yang itu."},{"who":"Dina","en":"But that one is more beautiful. It's the most beautiful pair in the shop!","id":"Tapi yang itu lebih bagus. Itu pasangan paling bagus di toko ini!"},{"who":"Rani","en":"Yes, but it is the most expensive, too.","id":"Ya, tapi itu juga yang paling mahal."},{"who":"Dina","en":"Hmm, this blue pair is as nice as that one, and it is cheaper.","id":"Hmm, sepatu biru ini sama bagusnya dengan yang itu, dan lebih murah."},{"who":"Rani","en":"Great, let's buy it!","id":"Bagus, ayo kita beli!"}]},{"t":"summary","items":["Pendek: [[tall → taller → the tallest]]. Panjang: [[beautiful → more beautiful → the most beautiful]].","Tidak beraturan: [[good → better → the best]], [[bad → worse → the worst]].","Comparative + **than**. Superlative + **the**.","[[as ... as]] = sama; [[not as ... as]] = tidak sama.","Aturan ejaan: [[big → bigger]], [[large → larger]], [[happy → happier]]."]}],"practice":[{"type":"match","q":"Pasangkan kata sifat dengan comparative-nya:","pairs":[["tall","taller"],["big","bigger"],["happy","happier"],["large","larger"],["fast","faster"]],"exp":"big → bigger (gandakan g); happy → happier; large → larger.","k":"5c7bdae5"},{"type":"match","q":"Pasangkan kata sifat dengan superlative-nya:","pairs":[["good","the best"],["bad","the worst"],["beautiful","the most beautiful"],["easy","the easiest"],["hot","the hottest"]],"exp":"good → the best (tidak beraturan); beautiful → the most beautiful.","k":"4c63362b"},{"type":"fill","id":"Dia lebih tinggi daripada aku.","q":"He is ___ than me. (tall)","answers":["taller"],"hint":"tall + er","exp":"Pendek → -er: taller.","k":"a272a1e5"},{"type":"fill","id":"Kucing itu lebih besar.","q":"The cat is ___. (big)","answers":["bigger"],"hint":"big → bigg + er","exp":"Gandakan g: bigger.","k":"c26d2fd1"},{"type":"fill","id":"Pelajaran ini lebih sulit.","q":"This lesson is ___ difficult.","answers":["more"],"hint":"more / most ?","exp":"difficult panjang → more difficult.","k":"cea8cd4c"},{"type":"fill","id":"Dia siswa paling pintar.","q":"She is the ___ student. (smart)","answers":["smartest"],"hint":"smart + est","exp":"Superlative pendek → the smartest.","k":"00caca78"},{"type":"fill","id":"Ini kue terbaik.","q":"This is the ___ cake. (good)","answers":["best"],"hint":"good → ...","exp":"good → better → the best.","k":"14574c7a"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Pilih kalimat yang benar.","options":["She is more taller than me.","She is taller than me.","She is tallest than me.","She is more tall than me."],"answer":1,"exp":"Pendek: -er + than.","k":"0f61dab9"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Pilih kalimat yang benar.","options":["This bag is expensiver than that bag.","This bag is more expensive than that bag.","This bag is most expensive than that bag.","This bag is more expensiver than that bag."],"answer":1,"exp":"expensive panjang → more expensive + than.","k":"e2db3839"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Pilih kalimat yang benar.","options":["Mount Everest is highest mountain in the world.","Mount Everest is the highest mountain in the world.","Mount Everest is the most high mountain in the world.","Mount Everest is higher mountain in the world."],"answer":1,"exp":"Superlative: the + adjective-est.","k":"ccf64f53"},{"type":"order","q":"Susun kalimat: \"Cheetah lebih cepat daripada singa.\"","answer":"A cheetah is faster than a lion.","exp":"A + hewan + is + adjective-er + than + a + hewan.","k":"1f92589e"},{"type":"order","q":"Susun kalimat: \"Rani sama tingginya dengan Dina.\"","answer":"Rani is as tall as Dina.","exp":"as + adjective + as.","k":"a3efbd08"},{"type":"mcq","q":"\"Today is worse than yesterday.\" artinya...","options":["Hari ini lebih buruk daripada kemarin.","Hari ini lebih baik daripada kemarin.","Hari ini paling buruk.","Hari ini sama dengan kemarin."],"answer":0,"exp":"worse = lebih buruk.","k":"1e43bc4b"},{"type":"listen","q":"Dengarkan. Siapa yang paling tinggi?","say":"Budi is the tallest in the class","options":["Budi paling tinggi di kelas","Budi lebih tinggi dari temannya","Budi sama tinggi dengan temannya","Budi paling pendek di kelas"],"answer":0,"exp":"the tallest = paling tinggi.","k":"cbfc87e7"},{"type":"listen","q":"Dengarkan. Apa artinya?","say":"My bag is not as heavy as yours","options":["Tasku tidak seberat tasmu","Tasku lebih berat dari tasmu","Tasku paling berat","Tasku sama beratnya dengan tasmu"],"answer":0,"exp":"not as ... as = tidak sama (kurang) ...","k":"32796a98"},{"type":"match","q":"Pasangkan kata sifat dengan comparative-nya:","pairs":[["small","smaller"],["hot","hotter"],["easy","easier"],["heavy","heavier"],["cheap","cheaper"]],"exp":"hot → hotter (gandakan t); easy → easier.","k":"66e89bdb"},{"type":"match","q":"Pasangkan kata sifat dengan superlative-nya:","pairs":[["long","the longest"],["fast","the fastest"],["expensive","the most expensive"],["interesting","the most interesting"],["bad","the worst"]],"exp":"Pendek: -est; panjang: the most.","k":"7bc60b97"},{"type":"match","q":"Pasangkan kata sifat dengan bentuk tidak beraturan:","pairs":[["good","better"],["bad","worse"],["good (superlative)","the best"],["bad (superlative)","the worst"]],"exp":"Dua kata sifat tidak beraturan.","k":"d17ad765"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Pilih kalimat yang benar.","options":["My bag is heavier than your bag.","My bag is more heavy than your bag.","My bag is heavyer than your bag.","My bag is heaviest than your bag."],"answer":0,"exp":"heavy → heavier.","k":"83fc22ae"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Pilih kalimat yang benar.","options":["This book is more interesting than that one.","This book is interestinger than that one.","This book is most interesting than that one.","This book is more interesting that that one."],"answer":0,"exp":"more + adjective + than.","k":"9b9815e0"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Pilih kalimat yang benar.","options":["Rani is the smartest student in my class.","Rani is smartest student in my class.","Rani is the most smart student in my class.","Rani is smarter student in my class."],"answer":0,"exp":"the + smartest.","k":"730dde07"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Pilih kalimat yang benar.","options":["Today is hotter than yesterday.","Today is hoter than yesterday.","Today is more hot than yesterday.","Today is hottest than yesterday."],"answer":0,"exp":"hot → hotter.","k":"6274f297"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Pilih kalimat yang benar.","options":["This is the best day of my life.","This is the goodest day of my life.","This is the most good day of my life.","This is better day of my life."],"answer":0,"exp":"good → the best.","k":"09cef91c"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Pilih kalimat yang benar.","options":["Bandung is not as big as Jakarta.","Bandung is not so bigger as Jakarta.","Bandung not as big as Jakarta.","Bandung is not as bigger as Jakarta."],"answer":0,"exp":"not as + adjective dasar + as.","k":"a783a31c"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Arti \"My brother is older than me\" adalah...","options":["Kakakku lebih tua daripada aku.","Kakakku paling tua.","Kakakku sama tuanya denganku.","Kakakku lebih muda dariku."],"answer":0,"exp":"older than = lebih tua daripada.","k":"bd5ca1a1"},{"type":"fill","id":"Gajah lebih besar daripada kuda.","q":"An elephant is ___ than a horse. (big)","answers":["bigger"],"hint":"big → bigg + er","exp":"bigger.","k":"2d4f24f3"},{"type":"fill","id":"Pelajaran ini lebih mudah.","q":"This lesson is ___ than that one. (easy)","answers":["easier"],"hint":"easy → eas + ier","exp":"easier.","k":"77638f9f"},{"type":"fill","id":"Dia siswa paling rajin.","q":"She is the ___ diligent student.","answers":["most"],"hint":"more / most ?","exp":"Panjang → the most.","k":"cad496e1"},{"type":"fill","id":"Ini es krim termurah.","q":"This is the ___ ice cream. (cheap)","answers":["cheapest"],"hint":"cheap + est","exp":"cheapest.","k":"07d92e62"},{"type":"fill","id":"Kucingku seberat kucingmu.","q":"My cat is as ___ as your cat. (heavy)","answers":["heavy"],"hint":"adjective dasar","exp":"as + adjective dasar + as.","k":"f82aeecf"},{"type":"order","q":"Susun kalimat: \"Dina lebih tinggi daripada Rani.\"","answer":"Dina is taller than Rani.","exp":"Dina + is + taller + than + Rani.","k":"2b998805"},{"type":"order","q":"Susun kalimat: \"Everest adalah gunung tertinggi di dunia.\"","answer":"Everest is the highest mountain in the world.","exp":"the + highest.","k":"dc141ee2"},{"type":"order","q":"Susun kalimat: \"Tasku tidak semahal tasmu.\"","answer":"My bag is not as expensive as yours.","exp":"not as ... as.","k":"61768903"},{"type":"listen","q":"Dengarkan. Siapa yang lebih cepat?","say":"A cheetah is faster than a lion","options":["Cheetah","Singa","Keduanya sama","Tidak ada"],"answer":0,"exp":"faster than = lebih cepat daripada.","k":"8604c375"},{"type":"listen","q":"Dengarkan. Mana yang paling baik?","say":"This is the best restaurant in town","options":["Restoran ini terbaik di kota","Restoran ini lebih baik dari yang lain","Restoran ini paling mahal","Restoran ini paling jauh"],"answer":0,"exp":"the best = terbaik.","k":"31561375"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Baca: \"Budi is 150 cm tall. Rani is 155 cm tall. Dina is 160 cm tall.\" Siapa yang paling tinggi?","options":["Dina","Budi","Rani","Semua sama"],"answer":0,"exp":"160 cm.","k":"201ed3ec"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Baca: \"The red bag costs 100,000 rupiah. The blue bag costs 150,000 rupiah.\" Tas mana yang lebih murah?","options":["Tas merah","Tas biru","Sama","Tidak ada yang murah"],"answer":0,"exp":"red is cheaper.","k":"f63aa696"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Baca: \"Bali is smaller than Java. Sumatra is bigger than Java.\" Mana yang paling besar?","options":["Sumatra","Java","Bali","Semua sama"],"answer":0,"exp":"Sumatra > Java > Bali.","k":"09984312"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Baca dialog: A: \"Which is cheaper, the shirt or the jacket?\" B: \"___\"","options":["The shirt is cheaper than the jacket.","The shirt is cheapest.","The shirt is more cheap.","The shirt cheaper."],"answer":0,"exp":"Comparative.","k":"0f21fd70"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Baca dialog: A: \"Who is the tallest in your class?\" B: \"___\"","options":["Budi is the tallest.","Budi is taller.","Budi is more tall.","Budi tallest."],"answer":0,"exp":"Superlative.","k":"242655d6"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Mana kalimat yang SALAH?","options":["This is more good than that.","This is better than that.","This is the best.","This is good."],"answer":0,"exp":"good → better.","k":"5e06d90d"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Mana kalimat yang SALAH?","options":["She is more smarter than me.","She is smarter than me.","She is the smartest.","She is smart."],"answer":0,"exp":"tanpa more + -er.","k":"1269c630"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Mana kalimat yang SALAH?","options":["He is the taller student.","He is the tallest student.","He is taller than me.","He is tall."],"answer":0,"exp":"the tallest.","k":"594bc875"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Terjemahan \"Pelajaran ini lebih sulit daripada yang itu\" adalah...","options":["This lesson is more difficult than that one.","This lesson is difficulter than that one.","This lesson is most difficult than that one.","This lesson is more difficult that one."],"answer":0,"exp":"more difficult than.","k":"10f0eaf0"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Terjemahan \"Dia pelari tercepat di sekolah\" adalah...","options":["He is the fastest runner in the school.","He is the faster runner in the school.","He is fastest runner in school.","He is the most fast runner."],"answer":0,"exp":"the fastest.","k":"1a289e30"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Kata sifat yang tidak sama kelompoknya (cara membentuk comparative) adalah...","options":["beautiful","tall","fast","cheap"],"answer":0,"exp":"beautiful → more beautiful.","k":"8e7413c9"},{"type":"fill","id":"Dia lebih rajin daripada aku.","q":"She is ___ diligent than me.","answers":["more"],"hint":"m _ _ _","exp":"more diligent.","k":"fecf3e76"},{"type":"fill","id":"Gunung ini yang tertinggi.","q":"This is the ___ mountain. (high)","answers":["highest"],"hint":"high + est","exp":"highest.","k":"f544f779"},{"type":"fill","id":"Mobil itu lebih mahal.","q":"That car is more ___.","answers":["expensive"],"hint":"e _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _","exp":"more expensive.","k":"477fdd39"},{"type":"fill","id":"Hari ini lebih panas daripada kemarin.","q":"Today is ___ than yesterday. (hot)","answers":["hotter"],"hint":"hot → hott + er","exp":"hotter.","k":"82645afc"},{"type":"order","q":"Susun kalimat: \"Kakakku lebih tua daripada aku.\"","answer":"My brother is older than me.","exp":"older + than.","k":"731aa16d"},{"type":"order","q":"Susun kalimat: \"Ini buku paling menarik.\"","answer":"This is the most interesting book.","exp":"the most + adjective.","k":"aa66f543"},{"type":"listen","q":"Dengarkan. Mana yang lebih besar?","say":"An elephant is bigger than a horse","options":["Gajah","Kuda","Sama besar","Tidak ada"],"answer":0,"exp":"bigger than.","k":"f9d4afe3"},{"type":"listen","q":"Dengarkan. Apa artinya?","say":"She is the smartest student in the class","options":["Dia siswa terpintar di kelas","Dia lebih pintar dari temannya","Dia tidak pintar","Dia sama pintar"],"answer":0,"exp":"the smartest.","k":"711dce0f"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Situasi: Kamu membandingkan dua tas. Tas A Rp100.000 dan tas B Rp80.000. Apa yang kamu katakan?","options":["Bag B is cheaper than bag A.","Bag B is cheapest than bag A.","Bag B is more cheap than bag A.","Bag B is cheaper that bag A."],"answer":0,"exp":"cheaper than.","k":"87f5c047"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Situasi: Temanmu bertanya, \"Who is the fastest runner in your class?\" Rani yang tercepat. Jawabanmu?","options":["Rani is the fastest runner.","Rani is the faster runner.","Rani is fastest the runner.","Rani is most fast runner."],"answer":0,"exp":"the fastest.","k":"54253713"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Mana ejaan yang benar?","options":["bigger","biger","biggger","bigar"],"answer":0,"exp":"bigger.","k":"66aed432"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Mana ejaan yang benar?","options":["happier","happyer","hapier","happiyer"],"answer":0,"exp":"happier.","k":"d4c0b529"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Mana ejaan yang benar?","options":["the hottest","the hotest","the hottist","the hot-est"],"answer":0,"exp":"the hottest.","k":"0904ee72"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Pilih kata tanya yang tepat: \"___ is taller, Budi or Rani?\"","options":["Who","What","Where","When"],"answer":0,"exp":"Who.","k":"023a3718"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Pilih kata tanya yang tepat: \"___ is the biggest animal?\" (Paus biru.)","options":["What","Who","Where","How old"],"answer":0,"exp":"What.","k":"9058215c"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Pilih kata yang tepat: \"This room is ___ than that room.\" (besar)","options":["bigger","more big","biggest","bigger than"],"answer":0,"exp":"bigger.","k":"2fe2be54"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Pilih kata yang tepat: \"English is ___ than Math for me.\" (mudah)","options":["easier","more easy","easiest","easyer"],"answer":0,"exp":"easier.","k":"31cc8b25"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Pilih kata yang tepat: \"He is the ___ student in our class.\" (rajin)","options":["most diligent","diligenter","more diligent","diligentest"],"answer":0,"exp":"most diligent.","k":"0750879e"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Pilih kata yang tepat: \"My phone is as ___ as yours.\" (mahal)","options":["expensive","more expensive","most expensive","expensiver"],"answer":0,"exp":"as + adj + as.","k":"5da34a64"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Pilih kata yang tepat: \"The weather today is ___ than yesterday.\" (buruk)","options":["worse","worser","more bad","baddest"],"answer":0,"exp":"worse.","k":"ac7f6e56"},{"type":"fill","id":"Dia lebih tua daripada kakaknya.","q":"She is ___ than her sister. (old)","answers":["older"],"hint":"o _ _ _ _","exp":"older.","k":"aca060ed"},{"type":"fill","id":"Ini restoran terbaik.","q":"This is the ___ restaurant. (good)","answers":["best"],"hint":"b _ _ _","exp":"best.","k":"0afaa904"},{"type":"fill","id":"Pelajaran ini lebih menarik.","q":"This lesson is ___ interesting.","answers":["more"],"hint":"m _ _ _","exp":"more.","k":"45c2f943"},{"type":"order","q":"Susun kalimat: \"Cheetah adalah hewan tercepat di darat.\"","answer":"The cheetah is the fastest land animal.","exp":"the fastest.","k":"c0f6c323"},{"type":"order","q":"Susun kalimat: \"Tasku tidak sebesar tasmu.\"","answer":"My bag is not as big as yours.","exp":"not as ... as.","k":"f8166bcd"},{"type":"listen","q":"Dengarkan. Siapa yang paling tinggi?","say":"Budi is the tallest in the class","options":["Budi","Rani","Dina","Tom"],"answer":0,"exp":"tallest.","k":"b5ee42b6"},{"type":"listen","q":"Dengarkan. Mana yang lebih besar?","say":"A horse is bigger th